# Operator Helm charts: installed on k3d by deploy/k3d/atlas.sh and in clusters by the Argo CD platform apps
# (deploy/argocd/apps/*/platform.yaml). Keep the versions here and there in step (CI checks it).
# Format: <release> <namespace> <repository> <chart> <version>
strimzi       strimzi           https://strimzi.io/charts/                   strimzi-kafka-operator 1.3.0
cnpg          cnpg-system       https://cloudnative-pg.github.io/charts       cloudnative-pg         0.29.1
cert-manager  cert-manager      https://charts.jetstack.io                    cert-manager           v1.21.2
keda          keda              https://kedacore.github.io/charts             keda                   2.21.0
kyverno       kyverno           https://kyverno.github.io/kyverno/            kyverno                3.9.1
external-secrets external-secrets https://charts.external-secrets.io          external-secrets       2.13.0
